menu "Hygeia"

    config HY_DEBUG_CONSOLE
        bool "Serial debug console"
        default y
        help
            Line commands on the USB console for development (time, tap, shot, ...).
            Release builds set this to n.

    config HY_PMU_CHARGER_SETUP
        bool "Set up the AXP2101 charger at boot"
        default y
        help
            At boot, turn off the TS-pin measurement and set the charge target to 4.2 V and the
            constant charge current to 150 mA (sized for a 320 mAh cell). n leaves the charger as found.

endmenu
